.Lanon.bfd4107bfde1ba8247e7036a4c472cd7.4865:
	.ascii	"sh:property"
	.size	.Lanon.bfd4107bfde1ba8247e7036a4c472cd7.4865, 11

	.type	.Lanon.bfd4107bfde1ba8247e7036a4c472cd7.4866,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.bfd4107bfde1ba8247e7036a4c472cd7.4866,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.bfd4107bfde1ba8247e7036a4c472cd7.4866:
	.ascii	"A property shape nested under a property shape or a member shape judges each value node's (or member's) own properties, which live on that node's own @graph node; a JSON Schema keyword judges only the instance location it applies to and those beneath it, so none reaches them, and the nested shape is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.bfd4107bfde1ba8247e7036a4c472cd7.4866, 309

	.type	.Lanon.bfd4107bfde1ba8247e7036a4c472cd7.4867,@object
