	.section	.rodata..Lanon.bfd4107bfde1ba8247e7036a4c472cd7.4876,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.bfd4107bfde1ba8247e7036a4c472cd7.4876:
	.ascii	"A value-vocabulary class's member is identified by a blank node rather than a named individual, so it has no stable CURIE to enumerate; the member is dropped from the projected enum."
