.Lanon.bfd4107bfde1ba8247e7036a4c472cd7.4943:
	.ascii	"JSON Schema if/then/else dependent validation has no direct Pydantic v2 type-annotation equivalent; the conditional is preserved in model_json_schema() but is not enforced by model validation."
	.size	.Lanon.bfd4107bfde1ba8247e7036a4c472cd7.4943, 192

	.type	.Lanon.bfd4107bfde1ba8247e7036a4c472cd7.4944,@object
