.Lanon.bfd4107bfde1ba8247e7036a4c472cd7.4953:
	.ascii	"Pydantic v2 unions implement any-branch semantics and cannot enforce JSON Schema oneOf's exactly-one matching rule; runtime validation uses a union while model_json_schema() retains oneOf."
	.size	.Lanon.bfd4107bfde1ba8247e7036a4c472cd7.4953, 188

